    "preamble": "Ravikanth Annaladasu vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 31 August, 2020 Author: D.Ramesh Bench: D.Ramesh The Hon'Ble Sri Justice D.Ramesh Criminal Petition No.3476 of 2020 Order:",
    "facts": "This petition is filed under Section 482 of the Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973 by the petitioners, who are accused Nos.1 to 3, in Crime No.255 of 2020 on the file of Station House Officer, Narasaraopet Rural Police Station, Guntur District. The offences alleged are under sections 270, 273, 328 and 420 of the Indian Penal Code and Sections 56, 57(1) and 63 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 and Section 34(a) of the Andhra Pradesh Excise Act.",
